# ── Rust build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
/lib/.precomp/
/bindings/raku/lib/.precomp/
/bindings/raku/resources/libraries/
/bindings/julia/LLattice/docs/build/
/bindings/julia/LLattice/docs/Manifest.toml
/bindings/julia/**/target/

# ── LaTeX / TikZ intermediates ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# docs/diagrams/Makefile renders *.tex through the DVI route (latex → dvisvgm) and
# deletes these on success; they only survive a failed or interrupted build.
#
# NOTE: the rendered .svg figures ARE committed on purpose — the diagrams-as-code
# convention (docs/diagrams/README.md §5) commits both the text source and the
# rendered image — so never ignore figure outputs here.
*.aux
*.dvi
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc

# ── Editor / OS scratch files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
\#*\#
.\#*

# ─── Coq/Rocq proof build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────
proofs/coq/CoqMakefile
proofs/coq/CoqMakefile.conf
proofs/coq/.CoqMakefile.d
proofs/coq/*.vo
proofs/coq/*.vok
proofs/coq/*.vos
proofs/coq/*.glob
proofs/coq/*.aux
proofs/coq/.*.aux
